G0 Z6.000
G0 X3.000 Y7.500
G1 Z-3.000 F400
G1 X4.500 Y7.500 Z-3.000 F1500
G1 X3.000 Y9.000 Z-2.183 F1500
G1 X1.500 Y9.000 Z-1.500 F1500
G1 X1.500 Y10.500 Z-1.091 F1500
G0 Z6.000
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; M9              ; coolant/dust OFF — set dustCollection flag to emit M9 here
; Spindle off (dialect snippet — usually M5)
M5
G4 P3.0          ; dwell 3 s — spindle cool-down ramp before safe-Z retract
G0 Z203 ; safe Z retract — uses machine work area Z height
G0 X0 Y0                     ; park X Y at WCS origin (adjust to your preferred home)
M30              ; program end + rewind (Mach3 expects M30, not M2)
